<h3>Babak 4 (Indonesia → Bangladesh)</h3>
Babak 4 (Indonesia → Bangladesh).
Airdate: 21 Oktober 2012
<ul>
<li>Surabaya (Bandar Udara Internasional Juanda) ke Dhaka, Bangladesh (Bandar Udara Internasional Shahjalal)</li>
<li>Dhaka (Rubel Model Auto Mobiles)</li>
<ul>
<li>Dhaka</li>
</ul>
<li>Dhaka (Kawran Bazaar Shootkir Market)</li>
<li>Dhaka (Keranigonj Kholamora) ke Old Dhaka (Swarighat)</li>
<li>Old Dhaka (Shambazaar Chan Mia Ghat)</li>
